# Cloudflare headers for the STANDALONE admin.fnhub.app deploy.
# This deploy serves ONLY the admin/ folder (its own Pages/Worker project),
# so it carries its own CSP -- the nation repo's root _headers does not apply.
# The panel loads no third-party scripts; it only talks to the control-plane
# Supabase project (https://*.supabase.co) and uses one inline <style> block.
#
# script-src stays 'self' with NO 'unsafe-inline' -- that is deliberate, and it
# means inline onclick="..." handlers are BLOCKED (they fail silently, the
# button just does nothing). All panel buttons are wired through the delegated
# data-act listener in admin.js. Do not add 'unsafe-inline' to make an inline
# handler work; add a data-act case instead.
#
# fonts.googleapis.com (style-src) + fonts.gstatic.com (font-src) are allowed
# solely so the panel can load DM Sans and match the nation app's typography.
# Neither origin can execute script under this policy. To tighten back to
# 'self' only, self-host the DM Sans woff2 files in admin/ and drop both
# origins plus the <link> in index.html.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
